fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"videoparsersbad/h266parse.html#h266parse:config-interval","fragment":"\n\tconfig-interval\n\nThe interval in seconds to send the VPS, SPS and PPS insertion.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});